From: kotwicha
Subject: [PATCH] Input: synaptics - add LEN2073 to the SMBus list

LEN2073 is the TM3471 touchpad of the ThinkPad T14 Gen 2a and P14s
Gen 2 AMD. With i2c-piix4 providing Host Notify on the FCH aux port it
works over RMI4/SMBus, so list it and let psmouse choose InterTouch
without a module parameter.
---
diff --git a/drivers/input/mouse/synaptics.c b/drivers/input/mouse/synaptics.c
--- a/drivers/input/mouse/synaptics.c
+++ b/drivers/input/mouse/synaptics.c
@@ -192,6 +192,7 @@ static const char * const smbus_pnp_ids[] = {
 	"LEN2055", /* E580 */
 	"LEN2058", /* E490 */
 	"LEN2068", /* T14 Gen 1 */
+	"LEN2073",
 	"SYN1221", /* TUXEDO InfinityBook Pro 14 v5 */
 	"SYN3003", /* HP EliteBook 850 G1 */
 	"SYN3015", /* HP EliteBook 840 G2 */
